  "question": {
    "text": "A Carnot engine has efficiency of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. If the temperature of sink&nbsp;is reduced by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>, its efficiency increases by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. The temperature of the source will be :",
