  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Initial efficiency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#951;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>%</mo></math>, the increase in&nbsp;efficiency is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>%</mo></math>. Therefore, new efficiency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>30</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>65</mn><mo>%</mo></math>.</p><p>Efficiency of the Carnot engin is given by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#951;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p>When the temperature of the sink is decreased by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#951;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo>-</mo><mn>40</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>40</mn><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>H</mi></msub></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>266</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
